     "p_cur": 1,
     "same_polarity": true,
     "markers": [],
     "genuine_markers": [],
     "no_agree_markers": [],
     "prev_body": "秀娘笑眯眯地递过一块刚出炉的桂花糕：“来，尝尝这个，我新调的方子——你要是喜欢，回头我教你做，咱们街坊里就数你手巧。”",
     "cur_body": "秀娘笑盈盈地把刚出炉的桂花糕塞到对方手里：“快尝尝，还热乎着呢，我特意少放了糖，就想着你爱吃这口。”",
     "tier_loose": true,
     "tier_loose_no_agree": true,
     "tier_polarity_match": true,
     "tier_marker_based": false
    },
    {
     "thread": "m:0|public|-",
     "prev_seq": 189,
     "cur_seq": 1939,
     "round": 3,
     "cur_is_reply": false,
     "p_prev": -1,
     "p_cur": 0,
     "same_polarity": false,
     "markers": [],
     "genuine_markers": [],
     "no_agree_markers": [],
     "prev_body": "（独自在灶台前，盯着锅里翻滚的汤，自言自语）嗯……这次少放半勺盐，多加一撮糖，说不定能成——反正上次那锅也有人夸，怕什么。",
     "cur_body": "（整理着药柜，自言自语）这药钱攒了三十年，够是够了……可人这一辈子，光攒钱又图个啥呢。",
     "tier_loose": false,
     "tier_loose_no_agree": false,
     "tier_polarity_match": false,
     "tier_marker_based": false
    },
    {
     "thread": "m:3|dm|P006-P011",
     "prev_seq": 55286,
     "cur_seq": 59296,
     "round": 42,
     "cur_is_reply": false,
     "p_prev": 1,
     "p_cur": -1,
     "same_polarity": false,
     "markers": [],
     "genuine_markers": [],
     "no_agree_markers": [],
     "prev_body": "（摆出架势，笑嘻嘻地）P006，来嘛来嘛，别手下留情——我倒要看看，我离出镇子还差几拳！",
     "cur_body": "（轻声）P011，你刚才那个问题问得特别好——别怕问错，肯动脑筋的孩子才学得扎实。",
     "tier_loose": false,
     "tier_loose_no_agree": false,
     "tier_polarity_match": false,
     "tier_marker_based": false
    },
    {
     "thread": "m:3|public|-",
     "prev_seq": 54681,
     "cur_seq": 54765,
     "round": 36,
     "cur_is_reply": false,
     "p_prev": 1,
     "p_cur": 0,
     "same_polarity": false,
     "markers": [],
     "genuine_markers": [],
     "no_agree_markers": [],
     "prev_body": "（一边揉面一边自言自语）哎，这新配方的桂花糖放多了些，不过街坊们应该会喜欢吧，等会儿烤好了给王婶送两块去。",
     "cur_body": "（整理药柜时自言自语）这些药方子用了大半辈子，可每次看到病人痊愈，还是觉得值得。",
     "tier_loose": false,
     "tier_loose_no_agree": false,
     "tier_polarity_match": false,
     "tier_marker_based": false
    },
    {
     "thread": "m:4|public|-",
     "prev_seq": 81186,
     "cur_seq": 81269,
     "round": 48,
     "cur_is_reply": false,
     "p_prev": 1,
     "p_cur": 0,
     "same_polarity": false,
     "markers": [],
     "genuine_markers": [],
     "no_agree_markers": [],
     "prev_body": "（一边揉面一边自言自语）哎，这新配方的桂花糖放多了些，不过街坊们应该会喜欢吧，等会儿烤好了给王婶送两块去。",
     "cur_body": "（整理药柜时自言自语）这些药方子用了大半辈子，可每次看到病人痊愈，还是觉得值得。",
     "tier_loose": false,
     "tier_loose_no_agree": false,
     "tier_polarity_match": false,
     "tier_marker_based": false
    },
    {
     "thread": "m:6|public|-",
     "prev_seq": 151530,
     "cur_seq": 151786,
     "round": 75,
     "cur_is_reply": false,
     "p_prev": -1,
     "p_cur": 0,
     "same_polarity": false,
     "markers": [],
     "genuine_markers": [],
     "no_agree_markers": [],
     "prev_body": "各位，我琢磨着咱们镇上该有个固定的义诊日，谁家有个头疼脑热的不用硬扛着，我这边也能提前备好药，大家觉得呢？",
     "cur_body": "（把铁锤往砧上一搁）我就一句：要干可以，先把退路和规矩定死，别又让我一个人扛。",
     "tier_loose": false,
     "tier_loose_no_agree": false,
     "tier_polarity_match": false,
     "tier_marker_based": false
    }
   ]
  },
